{
  "name": "Eveil: HubSpot contacts and deals to Eveil",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HubSpot → Eveil\nEvery hour, the contacts created in HubSpot since the last run go to Eveil: **customers** are marked as existing clients (never emailed), everyone else is added as a prospect. Deals closed since the last run go back too: the people on a **won** or **lost** deal get that status in Eveil, so its campaigns count their wins.\n\n1. Every HubSpot node: pick a **HubSpot App Token** credential (private app with `crm.objects.contacts.read` and `crm.objects.deals.read`).\n2. Every Eveil node (**Mark existing clients**, **Add prospects**, **Find in Eveil**, **Set deal outcome**): replace `YOUR-PROJECT-SLUG` (and the domain if you self-host), and pick a **Bearer Auth** credential holding an Eveil API token (**Settings → API**).\n3. Custom deal pipeline? Change `closedwon` and `closedlost` in **Closed HubSpot deals** and **One item per deal**.\n4. Activate.\n\nUp to 100 new contacts and 100 closed deals an hour. Docs: https://docs.eveil.cloud/product/webhooks",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "7b8c9d0e-1f2a-4b3c-8d4e-5f6a7b8c9d0e",
      "name": "How to set up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8c9d0e1f-2a3b-4c4d-9e5f-6a7b8c9d0e1f",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/contacts/search",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ filterGroups: [{ filters: [{ propertyName: 'createdate', operator: 'GTE', value: String($now.minus({ minutes: 65 }).toMillis()) }] }], properties: ['email', 'firstname', 'lastname', 'jobtitle', 'company', 'website', 'lifecyclestage'], limit: 100 }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9d0e1f2a-3b4c-4d5e-8f6a-7b8c9d0e1f2a",
      "name": "New HubSpot contacts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Customers are marked as existing clients so Eveil never cold-emails them;\n// everyone else becomes a prospect. One request each, not one per person.\nconst people = ($input.first().json.results ?? []).map(person => person.properties);\nconst domain = website => (website || '').trim().toLowerCase()\n  .replace(/^[a-z]+:\\/\\//, '').replace(/^www\\./, '').split(/[/?#:]/)[0] || null;\n\nconst customers = people\n  .filter(p => p.lifecyclestage === 'customer')\n  .map(p => p.email || domain(p.website))\n  .filter(Boolean);\nconst prospects = people.filter(p => p.lifecyclestage !== 'customer').map(p => ({\n  email: p.email || null,\n  first_name: p.firstname || null,\n  last_name: p.lastname || null,\n  title: p.jobtitle || null,\n  company_name: p.company || null,\n  company_domain: domain(p.website),\n}));\n\nconst out = [];\nif (customers.length) out.push({ json: { kind: 'clients', body: { entries: customers } } });\nif (prospects.length) out.push({ json: { kind: 'contacts', body: { contacts: prospects } } });\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "0e1f2a3b-4c5d-4e6f-9a7b-8c9d0e1f2a3b",
      "name": "Split customers and prospects",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1f2a3b4c-5d6e-4f7a-8b9c-0d1e2f3a4b5c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.kind }}",
              "rightValue": "clients",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a3b4c5d-6e7f-4a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d",
      "name": "Customers?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://eveil.cloud/api/v1/projects/YOUR-PROJECT-SLUG/known-clients",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3b4c5d6e-7f8a-4b9c-8d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
      "name": "Mark existing clients",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://eveil.cloud/api/v1/projects/YOUR-PROJECT-SLUG/contacts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4c5d6e7f-8a9b-4c0d-9e1f-2a3b4c5d6e7f",
      "name": "Add prospects",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/deals/search",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ filterGroups: [{ filters: [{ propertyName: 'hs_lastmodifieddate', operator: 'GTE', value: String($now.minus({ minutes: 65 }).toMillis()) }, { propertyName: 'dealstage', operator: 'IN', values: ['closedwon', 'closedlost'] }] }], properties: ['dealstage'], limit: 100 }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5d6e7f8a-9b0c-4d1e-8f2a-3b4c5d6e7f81",
      "name": "Closed HubSpot deals",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// A won deal is `won` in Eveil, a lost one `lost`. Custom pipelines name\n// their stages differently: change both here and in Closed HubSpot deals.\nreturn ($input.first().json.results ?? []).map(deal => ({\n  json: { id: deal.id, status: deal.properties.dealstage === 'closedwon' ? 'won' : 'lost' },\n}));"
      },
      "id": "6e7f8a9b-0c1d-4e2f-9a3b-4c5d6e7f8a92",
      "name": "One item per deal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v4/objects/deals/{{ $json.id }}/associations/contacts",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7f8a9b0c-1d2e-4f3a-8b4c-5d6e7f8a9ba3",
      "name": "Deal contacts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Every person on the deal gets its outcome.\nconst deals = $('One item per deal').all();\nreturn $input.all().flatMap((item, i) => (item.json.results ?? []).map(contact => ({\n  json: { id: contact.toObjectId, status: deals[i].json.status },\n})));"
      },
      "id": "8a9b0c1d-2e3f-4a4b-9c5d-6e7f8a9b0cb4",
      "name": "One item per contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/contacts/{{ $json.id }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "properties",
              "value": "email"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9b0c1d2e-3f4a-4b5c-8d6e-7f8a9b0c1dc5",
      "name": "Contact email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Eveil knows people by address. Someone without one is skipped: an empty\n// filter would match everyone.\nconst contacts = $('One item per contact').all();\nreturn $input.all()\n  .map((item, i) => ({ json: { email: item.json.properties?.email, status: contacts[i].json.status } }))\n  .filter(item => item.json.email);"
      },
      "id": "0c1d2e3f-4a5b-4c6d-9e7f-8a9b0c1d2ed6",
      "name": "Email and outcome",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://eveil.cloud/api/v1/projects/YOUR-PROJECT-SLUG/contacts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.email }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1d2e3f4a-5b6c-4d7e-8f8a-9b0c1d2e3fe7",
      "name": "Find in Eveil",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Only people Eveil wrote to, or found: a deal with anyone else is not its own.\nconst outcomes = $('Email and outcome').all();\nreturn $input.all().flatMap((item, i) => {\n  const contact = item.json.data?.[0];\n  return contact ? [{ json: { id: contact.id, status: outcomes[i].json.status } }] : [];\n});"
      },
      "id": "2e3f4a5b-6c7d-4e8f-9a9b-0c1d2e3f4af8",
      "name": "Known to Eveil?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://eveil.cloud/api/v1/projects/YOUR-PROJECT-SLUG/contacts/{{ $json.id }}/status",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: $json.status }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3f4a5b6c-7d8e-4f9a-8bac-1d2e3f4a5b09",
      "name": "Set deal outcome",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        360
      ]
    }
  ],
